<section class="section_primary_content" style="background-color: #f0f0f0;">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="title_sec text-center simple_content_area">
			<h3>Welcome to Urban Homes Rotorua</h3>
<p>We’re excited to bring our stunning homes to Rotorua! Our Sales Office, perfectly situated in Redwood Park, Lynmore, is ready to welcome you &#8211; with an exciting show home set to arrive in 2025. Our friendly local team are here and ready to guide you at every stage of the journey.</p>
<p>Since 2004 Urban Homes has been designing and building quality homes throughout the greater Waikato, from Whitianga to Cambridge, and everywhere in between. We&#8217;ve now established ourselves in the wider Rotorua Lakes region to provide the same beautiful homes and relationships which last for generations.</p>
<p><em>Urban Homes has been operating in the Rotorua Lakes region since 2025 and is owned and operated by<br />
Ben and Ally Green of Grenoble Build Ltd.</em></p>
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: center;">
<div style="width: 640px;" class="wp-video"><video class="wp-video-shortcode" id="video-28979-1" width="640" height="360" poster="https://urban.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Ben-Green_Video-Cover.jpg" preload="metadata" controls="controls"><source type="video/mp4" src="https://urban.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ROTORUA_URBAN_Web.mp4?_=1" /><a href="https://urban.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ROTORUA_URBAN_Web.mp4">https://urban.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ROTORUA_URBAN_Web.mp4</a></video></div>
</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>


