											<div class="col-3">
							<div class="team_box">
																	<figure class="bg_set" style="background-image: url('https://urban.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Daisy-Wilson-Rogers_square-scaled.jpg')"></figure>
									
								<div class="team_content">
									<h4>Daisy Wilson-Rogers</h4>		
									<p>Apprentice Builder</p>									<div class="team_contacts">
										<ul>
											<li><a href="mailto:daisy.wilson-rogers@urban.co.nz"><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i></a></li>										</ul>
									</div>
																	</div>
							</div>
						</div>
											<div class="col-3">
							<div class="team_box">
																	<figure class="bg_set" style="background-image: url('https://urban.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Sydney-Gill_square-scaled.jpg')"></figure>
									
								<div class="team_content">
									<h4>Sydney Gill</h4>		
									<p>Apprentice Builder</p>									<div class="team_contacts">
										<ul>
											<li><a href="mailto:sydney.gill@urban.co.nz"><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i></a></li>										</ul>
									</div>
																	</div>
							</div>
						</div>
										</div>
				</div>
												<section class="image_content_sec">
					<div class="container">
						<div class="design_build_category">
							<div class="row">
								<div class="col-6">
																		<figure>
										<img src="https://urban.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Ben-Ally-scaled.jpg" alt="">
										<figcaption>BEN AND ALLY GREEN - FRANCHISE OWNERS</figcaption>
									</figure>
																	</div>
								<div class="col-6">
																		<div class="design_category_text">
										<h4>Introducing Ben and Ally, your local Urban Homes Rotorua team</h4>
										<p>We&#8217;re fortunate enough to call Rotorua home and it is a truly special place for us to raise our four kids! For us, it&#8217;s more than just a location; it&#8217;s a way of life. We have set up home in the idyllic Redwood Park, a stone’s throw from the world-famous Whakarewarewa Forest, where adventure is on our doorstep. We have world-class mountain biking, scenic running trails, and pristine lakes – all within easy reach (and land is available now! <a href="https://www.redwoodpark.nz/">Redwood Park, Rotorua</a>). We also love the rich culture and history that is ingrained in this very unique part of New Zealand.</p>
<p>As the owners of Urban Homes Rotorua, we’re dedicated to helping you create a home that’s as exceptional as this beautiful region.  Living and working here allows us to truly be part of the Rotorua community, from our involvement in the local schools and sports teams, to our passion for enjoying the stunning forest and lakes.</p>
<p>Urban Homes Rotorua is committed to crafting homes that complement the natural beauty of the area, working with trusted local suppliers and tradespeople to uphold our renowned standards of quality, care and integrity. We&#8217;ll guide you seamlessly through every stage of your building experience, ensuring a stress-free experience.</p>
<p>We are committed to this community for the long-haul, so we’re not just building quality homes; we’re building lasting relationships and stronger connections within this spectacular area. We’d love the opportunity to work with you to bring your vision to life. Together, let’s create a home you’ll be proud to call your own in the beautiful Rotorua Lakes region.</p>
<p>See you soon!</p>
<p><strong>Ben and Ally Green</strong><br />
<strong>Urban Homes Rotorua</strong></p>
						
				        			</div>
				        											</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</section>
							</div>
